lines.push("", "M-04 formal H264 720p memory trials (2026-10-04): evidence/h264-private-memory-2026-10-04.json retains four attempts and full process/realm/queue samples. The genuine 105,000,218-byte 60s 1280x720/30fps source yields identical 19,137,689-byte H264 outputs, 1,800 decoded frames, exact frame times and both AAC hashes, Unicode metadata/chapter, SSIM 0.987575. Initial CDP >50 MiB selection failure was fixed using real DOM.setFileInputFiles, not a smaller fixture. Synchronous slices fail at 268.430 MiB incremental complete-tree private memory. BYOB measures 245.574 MiB once but fails the initial local-resource guard; a fresh BYOB repeat fails memory at 269.172 MiB. Its exact TTS script is proven a body-free local read from its own extension service worker; that one resource is separately recorded, never a wildcard network exemption, and no process is omitted. No candidate or speed optimization is accepted. Native browser-job elapsed times are 27.392, 28.529 and 30.796 s. All media/fixture/profile/temp copies are deleted and staged assets restored; retain compact reports/traces and the 8,294,487-byte static private tool. Worker heaps are unavailable/null; next investigate accessible worker allocations and a smaller fixed native-memory candidate. Public registry and engines remain unchanged.");

